  "ingredients": [
    "1 (1 ounce) package dry onion soup mix",
    "1 (3 pound) pork sirloin roast",
    "1 (16 ounce) can whole berry cranberry sauce",
    "2 tablespoons butter, or to taste",
    "2 tablespoons all-purpose flour, or as needed",
    "salt and ground black pepper to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/YwWq_4eIFF-a-lw3D4sjE96Hnp0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/235924-slow-cooker-pork-roast-ddmfs-0163-4x3-step-01-a5d3f35ae1f3461ca40b9787a4657def.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235924/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Rub soup mix all over pork roast. Place roast in a slow cooker and pour cranberry sauce over top. Cover and cook on Low until pork is slightly pink in the center, about 8 to 10 hours. An instant-read thermometer inserted into the center should read at least 145 degrees F (63 degrees C). Transfer roast to a platter, reserving juices in the slow cooker.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/FahfkAK3egBnWxzS5Dh_BnMIB-s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/235924-slow-cooker-pork-roast-DDMFS_4x3_Step_03-0187141662d844828dc4fd1bfbf03144.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235924/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Melt butter in a saucepan over low heat. Whisk in flour to form a paste. Pour in reserved juices from the slow cooker; cook, whisking constantly, until gravy lightens in color and thickens, about 5 minutes. Season with salt and pepper. Serve alongside roast.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/1375KX0Ug9osiEnQis_FtMNRZq0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/235924-slow-cooker-pork-roast-DDMFS_4x3_Step_04-03e7172f90464e3bad22cb45b854eb84.jpg"
